      "id": 13,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "# Distributed Tracing with Jaeger\n\nThis dashboard shows metrics collected from OpenTelemetry instrumentation. To explore individual traces:\n\n1. **View all traces**: [Open Jaeger UI](http://localhost:16686)\n2. **Search by service**: Select \"example-service\" from the service dropdown\n3. **Filter by operation**: Choose specific endpoints (GET /products, POST /products, etc.)\n4. **Find traces by tag**: Search by custom span attributes (product.sku, user.id, etc.)\n5. **Correlate with logs**: Copy trace_id from logs and search in Jaeger\n\n## Trace Analysis Tips\n\n- **Latency spikes**: Look for long-running spans in the waterfall view\n- **Error traces**: Filter by tag `error=true` to find failed requests\n- **Database queries**: Expand spans to see SQL queries and their duration\n- **External API calls**: Identify slow third-party services\n- **Parallel operations**: See which operations run concurrently vs sequentially\n\n## Custom Instrumentation\n\nAdd custom span attributes in your code:\n\n```typescript\nimport { addSpanAttributes } from '@monorepo/otel'\n\naddSpanAttributes({\n  'product.sku': dto.sku,\n  'product.category': dto.category,\n  'user.id': userId\n})\n```\n\nThen search by these attributes in Jaeger!",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.2.3",
      "title": "How to Explore Traces",
      "type": "text"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "5s",
